 36AR c  Measurement of half-life limit for 0|n|e|e decay mode                  
 36AR2c  of {+36}Ar using Phase I and II of GERDA (GERmanium Detector Array)    
 36AR3c  at the Gran Sasso underground (LNGS) of INFN-Italy.                    
 36AR4c  The detector array is immersed in a cryostat containing 64 m{+3}       
 36AR5c  of LAr. Abundance of {+36}Ar in natural Ar is 0.3336%, resulting       
 36AR6c  in 298 kg of {+36}Ar.  Measured |g spectrum, searched for 429.88|g     
 36AR7c  by taking energy cut from 410 to 450 keV. Deduced limit of T{-1/2}     
 36AR8c  for 0|n|e|e decay mode.                                                
 36AR9c  Data includes 3.08 y of Phase II and 1.26 y of Phase I.                
